{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日はOFFの日でした‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋の掃除と、いろいろやってたら\n時間があっという間です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母ちゃんと買い物も行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい服買ってもらったので\n握手会で着ようかな♪るんるん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京での個別握手会楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー早くにぎにぎしたーーーーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアースタイルは\nストレート毛先ちょい巻\nダウンゆる巻\nお団子\nとかで迷ってますぞよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オオカミの足スリッパ持ってこよっかなえへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジアムライブの時"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはると♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真ポニーテールてわかりますか⁇\nよかったら感想をお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールのイメージよりも\nポニーテールの方が合ってるのかな?\nて最近思ってたり、ね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからは質問回答"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんはNMB48の写真や缶バッチを\n持っていますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってません><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんが春いちばんたのしみなことは何っ？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花見‼\n春の空気とか風がすきなので\n外にいたいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最近くしゃみすごいのよx(\nま...まさか...\nかっかふんしょ......びゃっくしょいっっっっああー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の万理華ちゃんのブームは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの最近のマイブームってなにー？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご大福おいしい。\n生のいちごもおいしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご最高"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも家出る何分前に起きるー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいたい3時間前に起きるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしゃ目覚まし何個設定してるか...あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかの今の夢って何ですか？\n僕達が力になれることってありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのままでいてください＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の夢は...\n私の笑顔で沢山の人が\n笑顔いっぱいになってほしい。\n今だけじゃなく、これからもずっとそう‼\n笑うことって大事です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのコメントや\nお手紙、プレゼント、直接会って、\nすごいパワーをもらっています。\nすごく笑顔になります。すごく元気になります。\nそれと同じように私もいろんな人に\nパワーを与えたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内面から輝ける人になりたい＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの得意教科なんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育と美術です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...怒らないで←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"82回目のブログより\nパーティーの写真で、べびたんが、\n手にもってるものはなんだろう？(^o^)/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カップケーキ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺も質問してもいいのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんですともっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声のフェチ？\nどんな感じですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな声が好みなのか興味があります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やんわり小声のつぶやく感じの声が\nすきなんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ⁇マニアックって⁇笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺、ストール大好きで20着くらい持ってるんだけど、\nストール男子はどう思いますか？\nちなみに首に巻くのと、\n腰に巻くのはどっちがオシャレだと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もストール女子だったりします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストール男子ありですっ♪\n大ぶりで顔の半分見えないバランスとか\nいいですよね^^\n腰に巻いたことない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参考になりますっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんって\n女子高校生に好きって\nいわれて嬉しい？☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃもうむちゃくちゃうれしいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢も近いから、いろんな話できる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいお話したいです:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーツの男はどない？笑っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーツって大人にイメージがあるな。\nしゃきーんて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の子の髪色で好きなのって\nあったりするのかなー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に似合ってれば\n何色でも良いなて思います。\n自分的にはナチュラルな感じ好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でこ出したい時って\n自分になんらかの変化があった時なの？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋とかちはる見てると\nいーな、懐かしいなって思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段出かけるときはその日の気分で\nおでこちゃん出すかスタイルを決めてます:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃アニメ見てた？\n私はよく見てたんだけど、\nおジャ魔女どれみって分かる ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おジャ魔女どれみ知ってる知ってる知ってる‼‼‼\nめっちゃ懐かしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと見てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようマネしてたなあぁ。\n変身の杖持ってました♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんってペット飼ってるん？？\nもし飼ってたら名前教えてね！！( 'Θ' )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むかしハムちゃん飼ってました\nラッキーちゃんとハッピーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「え、ちょ、ネーミングセンス...」\nとか言わんといてぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじさんだけど、\nベビたんのファンになっても良いのかな？\nって、もう、なってるよ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツッコんでるっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいすごいうれしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばっきゅんします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの夢が見れる魔法ってなんだっけ？(笑)\nちちんぷいぷいだっけ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちちんぷいぷいずんちゃずんずんずんちゃっちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n笑\nみんな笑っていいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わらわらわら←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さくまり」\nって呼んでいいですか?笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、まりかって呼んで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生映画って興味ある??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観たことないのですが、\n映画だいすきなので観たいなぁ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女マンガ読む男の子って変かな???"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変じゃなーーい‼\n私は少女漫画しか読んでないけど、\n少年漫画読んでる女の子いっぱいいますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女漫画は読むと女の子の気持ちが分かりそう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0035.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0036.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらもうこんな時間‼\nおやすみなさいっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーーーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/3718898/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}